{"name":"Loveable","hex":"#f0c1c6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"loveable","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Alternative form of lovable."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/loveable"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jill Corey","blocks":[{"text":"Jill Corey was an American popular standards singer. She was discovered and signed on one day when she was 17. She went on to have her own radio shows and to star in a feature film."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Jill_Corey_1955.JPG/330px-Jill_Corey_1955.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jill_Corey"},{"title":"This Is What the Truth Feels Like","blocks":[{"text":"This Is What the Truth Feels Like is the third studio album by American singer Gwen Stefani. It was released on March 18, 2016, by Interscope Records. Initially, the album was scheduled to be released in December 2014 with Stefani working with a handful of high-profile producers, and Benny Blanco serving as executive producer. However, after the underperformance of her 2014 singles and the writer's block Stefani suffered, she did not feel comfortable curating an album and scrapped the whole record in favor of starting again. The album's release was scheduled after Stefani hinted at it on her Twitter account."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3f/Gwen_Stefani_-_This_Is_What_the_Truth_Feels_Like_%28Official_Album_Cover%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/This_Is_What_the_Truth_Feels_Like"},{"title":"Loveable (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Loveable is a 2024 drama film directed, written and edited by Lilja Ingolfsdottir in her feature directorial debut. It stars Helga Guren as a housewife navigating life after her husband, played by Oddgeir Thune, decides to end their marriage."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/aa/Loveable_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loveable_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg/500px-Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg/1280px-Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg/500px-Jill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Corey in 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJill-Corey_2013-11-16.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Gavin_Rossdale.jpg/500px-Gavin_Rossdale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Gavin_Rossdale.jpg/1280px-Gavin_Rossdale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Gavin_Rossdale.jpg/500px-Gavin_Rossdale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGavin_Rossdale.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Blake_Shelton_July_2017_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Blake_Shelton_July_2017_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Blake_Shelton_July_2017_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Blake_Shelton_July_2017_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/